hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1745","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Fitna ki ladai key baarey mein tumhaari kya raey hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Aur kya tum jaantey ho ke fitna kya hai? Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mushrikeen se ladtey they jabke un par daakhil hona fitna tha. Aur wo tumhaari baadshahat par ladai jaisa nahi hai. (Bukhari: 4651). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur doosrey jinhon-ne apne gunaahon ka iqraar kya) aayat."
